+-- The ruinplate helm (the Ruinplate gown's headpiece): a tall pale stone crest
+-- and an old bronze circlet over a dark headcloth that wraps the crown, cheeks
+-- and jaw, leaving only a face window. A pale veil falls behind to the
+-- shoulders with a bronze hem, so the pale stone carries round the back; moss
+-- has taken the crest's left foot.
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
